Tecplot files of the per-cell values: denstemptest_EbandNN.dat

Written by ena_run with --tecplot (or [run] tecplot_cells = true in the settings file),
single-ion model, steady-state runs: one file per band, with every grid cell's values at the
band's centre energy, in the 43 columns of the original code's file.

The files have a Tecplot header, so they load directly in Tecplot (File > Load Data);
header.dat is no longer needed. For faster loading, Tecplot's preplot can convert one to
binary:

preplot denstemptest_EbandNN.dat denstemptest_EbandNN.plt
